  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_agency": null,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The applicant has failed to demonstrate, on the balance of probability, continuous use of 55 Millbrook Road, London, N9 7HY as a five-person HMO within Use Class C4 throughout the relevant statutory period. Council records demonstrate an intervening C3(b) use in 2017. In addition, the claimed C4 use would contravene enforcement notice ENF/16/0001, which remains in force and requires that use to cease. The use is therefore not lawful under section 191(2) of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990, and the Certificate is refused."
  ],
